flowchart TD
  A[Input: N] --> B{Library}
  B -->|factorization_benchmark_library| C[Order Finding]
  B -->|optimized_harmonic_lib| D[Harmonic Classification]

  %% Order finding
  C --> E{"Category by trial division up to 1000"}
  E --> F[Twin Prime σ=1/10]
  E --> G[Cousin Prime σ=1/10]
  E --> H[Universal σ=1/10]
  E --> I[Large Numbers σ=1/15]
  F --> J["Bases a = 2, 3, 5, 7"]
  G --> J
  H --> J
  I --> J
  J --> K[GCD Check]
  K --> L{Divisor Found?}
  L -->|Yes| M[Factors Found]
  L -->|No| N["Next r with a^r ≡ 1 mod N"]
  N --> O{"Score above 1/1000? always for σ = 1/10"}
  O -->|Yes| P["gcd of a^(r/2) ± 1 and N"]
  O -->|No| Q[Next Period]
  Q --> N
  P --> R{Proper Divisor?}
  R -->|Yes| M
  R -->|No| S["Next base or no result"]

  %% Harmonic classification
  D --> T[Factors p, q by trial division]
  T --> U[Calculate Ratio]
  U --> V[Octave Reduction]
  V --> W{Optimizations Active?}
  W -->|Yes| X[Cache Check Frequent Ratios]
  W -->|No| Y[Hierarchical Search without Optimization]
  X -->|Cache Hit| Z[Immediate Assignment]
  X -->|Cache Miss| AA[Level Prediction]
  AA --> BB[Bounds Search over All Levels]
  BB -->|Hit| CC[Assignment from Bounds Search]
  BB -->|No Hit| DD[Hierarchical Search]
  DD --> EE{Level 1: BASIS}
  EE -->|3:2, 5:4, 4:3| FF[Classical Harmonies]
  EE -->|No Match| GG{Level 2: EXTENDED}
  GG -->|11:8, 13:8, 7:4| HH[Jazz Harmonies]
  GG -->|No Match| II{Level 3: COMPLEX}
  II -->|29:16, 31:16| JJ[Spectral Music]
  II -->|No Match| KK{Level 4: ULTRA}
  KK -->|37:32, 61:32| LL[Xenharmonic Ratios]
  KK -->|No Match| MM[No Target Ratio within Tolerance]

  Y --> EE

  %% Outputs
  Z --> NN[Interval Name of the Factor Ratio]
  CC --> NN
  FF --> NN
  HH --> NN
  JJ --> NN
  LL --> NN

  M --> OO[Result: Factors or Interval Name]
  NN --> OO

  style A fill:#e1f5fe
  style OO fill:#c8e6c9
  style M fill:#c8e6c9
  style NN fill:#e8f5e8
  style MM fill:#ffcdd2
  style S fill:#ffcdd2
